{"id":"032afcabb191e061","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-computable-continuous.md","title":"Cantor空间上的可计算连续实值函数","display":"df-computable-continuous — Cantor空间上的可计算连续实值函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-computable-continuous","aliases":["43-df-computable-continuous"],"display":"df-computable-continuous — Cantor空间上的可计算连续实值函数","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-infseq]]","[[43-df-effective-coding]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本地分析接口；与原书§4.2 Cantor空间设定相容","source_scope":"local-support","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-computable-continuous"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-computable-continuous</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable-continuous — Cantor空间上的可计算连续实值函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本地分析接口；与原书§4.2 Cantor空间设定相容"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-support"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:2^\\omega\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(f:2^\\omega\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathbb N\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb Q\">\\(q:\\mathbb N\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb Q\\)</span> 均总定义。有理输出经有效编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ComputableContinuous}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\exists q:\\mathbb N\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Computable}(m)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\ (|q(n,X\\upharpoonright m(n))-f(X)|\\le2^{-n})\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ComputableContinuous}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\exists q:\\mathbb N\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Computable}(m)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\ (|q(n,X\\upharpoonright m(n))-f(X)|\\le2^{-n})\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>以一致可计算的有限柱集阶梯函数给出有效一致逼近；紧Cantor空间上这与总Type-2可计算实值函数等价。此为概率论补充节点的内建接口，原书本稿未定位到这一独立定义；不宣称来自书中某定理。</p>\n<p>来源：本地分析接口；与原书§4.2 Cantor空间设定相容。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。 此项为支撑原有形式化的有效分析基础，非声称原书有独立同名定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-coding]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f:2^\\omega\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathbb N\\times2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ComputableContinuous}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\exists q:\\mathbb N\\times2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Computable}(m)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\ (|q(n,X\\upharpoonright m(n))-f(X)|\\le2^{-n})\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1619,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-continuous]] — Cantor空间上的可计算连续实值函数"},{"id":"d2ee5ae1d74b5b33","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $T:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega$ 满足 $\\operatorname{ComputableCantorMap}(T)$（see [[43-df-computable-cantor-map]]），$f:2^\\omega\\to\\mathbb R$ 满足 $\\operatorname{ComputableContinuous}(f)$（see [[43-df-computable-continuous]]）。$\\mu$、$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 采用 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币Borel概率空间。假设 $\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\mu(T^{-1}[B])=\\mu(B)$ 及 $\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\mu(T^{-1}[B]\\triangle B)=0\\Rightarrow\\mu(B)\\in\\{0,1\\})$。可积函数集合 $\\mathcal L^1(\\mu)$ 与实值 Lebesgue 积分采用 [[43-df-measure]] 的正式定义，并明列积分定义域条件 $f\\in\\mathcal L^1(\\mu)$。设 $X\\in2^\\omega$ 满足 [[43-df-mlrandom]] 的 $\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)$。"}],"outgoing":["f357216a7edb035a","565c3258eee2a5ff","aa33e0ea8422ba2a"]}